---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { getAlternateUrls } from '../i18n/utils'
import EmailObfuscated from '../components/EmailObfuscated.astro'
const alternates = getAlternateUrls(Astro.url.pathname)
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sobre mí — Yukiteru"
  description="Yukiteru (volfread) — desarrollador, sysadmin y activista SL Venezuela. Bitcoiner y poweruser GNU/Linux."
  lang="es"
  alternates={alternates}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">Hola, soy Yukiteru</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-widest text-volf-muted uppercase">
      Desarrollador de software, sysadmin y activista del software libre en Venezuela.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
      Me apasiona construir herramientas de alto rendimiento, librerías open-source y experiencias
      web interactivas, siempre con un enfoque firme en
      <span class="text-volf-text">rendimiento</span>,{' '}
      <span class="text-volf-text">accesibilidad</span>,
      <span class="text-volf-text">seguridad (hardening)</span> y{' '}
      <span class="text-volf-text">construcción comunitaria</span>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">¿Qué hago?</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Desarrollo</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Principalmente con <span class="text-volf-orange">Go</span>,{' '}
          <span class="text-volf-orange">Python</span> y{' '}
          <span class="text-volf-orange">TypeScript</span>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Infraestructura</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Despliegue y optimización de herramientas open-source, CMS y seguridad en sistemas
          GNU/Linux.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Ecosistema Tech</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Bitcoiner, redactor especializado en contenido técnico y poweruser Linux.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">BSD & Slackware</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Miembro de la comunidad y creador de <span class="text-volf-orange">ports</span> en{' '}
          <span class="text-volf-text">FreeBSD</span>, <span class="text-volf-text">OpenBSD</span> y{' '}
          <span class="text-volf-text">Slackware</span> — packaging, hardening y mantenimiento.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Medios y colaboraciones</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a
        href="https://observatorioblockchain.com/author/jose-maldonado/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4 hover:border-volf-orange/30 hover:bg-volf-surface transition"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold group-hover:text-volf-orange transition">
          Observatorio Blockchain
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">mar 2019 — actualidad</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Análisis y divulgación blockchain — perfil de autor
        </p>
        <span class="mt-2 inline-flex text-xs font-medium text-volf-orange">Ver perfil →</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://academy.bit2me.com/author-jose-maldonado/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4 hover:border-volf-orange/30 hover:bg-volf-surface transition"
      >
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold group-hover:text-volf-orange transition">Bit2Me Academy</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">feb 2019 — actualidad</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Contenido educativo cripto — perfil de autor
        </p>
        <span class="mt-2 inline-flex text-xs font-medium text-volf-orange">Ver perfil →</span>
      </a>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Cointelegraph</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">mar 2020 — dic 2021</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">Colaboración en contenidos</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Criptotendencias</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">nov 2018 — nov 2019</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">Redacción — 13 artículos</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">Bitcobie</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">ene 2019 — jun 2019</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
          Redactor de contenidos — tecnología blockchain
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface/60 p-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-volf-text">DesdeLinux</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-volf-muted">mar 2015 — jun 2017</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">Colaboración en contenidos</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-volf-muted">
      Comunidades
    </h3>
    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {['Debian', 'Gentoo', 'FreeBSD', 'OpenBSD', 'Slackware'].map((c) => (
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-volf-glass-border bg-volf-surface/60 backdrop-blur px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-volf-muted">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-volf-orange" /> {c}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Contacto</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-volf-border bg-volf-surface p-5">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-volf-muted uppercase font-semibold">
        Correo electrónico
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center rounded-xl border border-volf-border bg-white px-4 py-3">
        <EmailObfuscated class="text-volf-bg" />
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3">
        <a
          href="/publickey.asc"
          download="yukiteru-volfread.asc"
          type="application/pgp-keys"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-volf-orange hover:text-volf-orange-soft hover:underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-volf-orange rounded-full px-1"
          aria-label="Descargar clave pública PGP"
        >
          <svg
            width="12"
            height="12"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M12 15l-4-4h8z"></path>
            <path d="M12 3v12"></path>
            <path d="M4 17v2a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-2"></path>
          </svg>
          Descarga mi clave pública PGP
        </a>
        <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-volf-muted-2">(asc, 1.1K)</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-volf-muted-2">
        Sin enlace directo para evitar spam. Imagen no copiable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Mis Proyectos</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
      Con más de 120 repositorios en GitHub, este sitio reúne una selección de mis trabajos más
      relevantes: desde librerías como
      <code class="text-volf-amber">fast-levenshtein</code>, herramientas de línea de comandos como{' '}
      <code class="text-volf-amber">koma</code>, hasta proyectos web como
      <code class="text-volf-amber">EclipseScope</code>. Todo construido para ser ligero, eficiente
      y desplegado estáticamente en Cloudflare Pages.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6">
      <a
        href="/proyectos"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-volf-orange to-volf-amber px-8 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-glow hover:shadow-glow-strong hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98] transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-volf-orange focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-volf-bg"
      >
        Ver proyectos →
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-volf-muted">
      Puedes encontrarme en{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/yukiteruamano" class="text-volf-orange hover:underline">
        GitHub
      </a>
      ,{' '}
      <a href="https://x.com/yukiteru_amano" class="text-volf-orange hover:underline">
        X
      </a>{' '}
      y{' '}
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jos%C3%A9-maldonado-4520a715a/"
        class="text-volf-orange hover:underline"
      >
        LinkedIn
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
